  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except L--sodium lactate and L--cysteine・H2O・HCl,adjust pH to 7.5 and autoclave under a N2 atmosphere. Separately autoclave L--sodium lactate and L--cysteine・H2O・HCl in 10 ml distilled water under a N2 atmosphere and add to the medium. Readjust pH to 7.5 with 1 N NaOH (from asterile stock solution)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "For preparation of solid medium, add 15 g/L agar (BD-Difco)."
    }
  ]
}